  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Broad based social security scheme is established</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Botswana approved the National Social Protection Framework (NSPF) in August 2020 to guide implementation of a national programs. The framework, seeks inter alia to strengthen coordination mechanisms for the implementation of social protection across all sectors.

During the 2024-2025 programme cycle, the ILO will support the development of measures, developed in consultation with the social partners and guided by international labour standards, with the purpose of extension of coverage, enhancement of the comprehensiveness of social protection or increase of benefit and service adequacy.</narrative>
  </description>
